s + YT overlay candidates\n39\t      frame-plan.json        # timestamps + why each frame matters\n40\t      lab-spec.md            # drills on course codebase only\n41\t  media/frames/tac-1/        # extract 5–12 frames if ffmpeg available\n42\t  vol-1-tac/                 # empty or stub README for later HTML\n43\t  vol-2-ah/\n44\t  vol-3-ma/\n45\t```\n46\t\n47\t### B) extract.json schema (required fields)\n48\t```json\n49\t{\n50\t  \"lesson_key\": \"tac-1-hello-agentic-coding\",\n51\t  \"title\": \"Hello Agentic Coding\",\n52\t  \"course\": \"TAC\",\n53\t  \"order\": 1,\n54\t  \"tactic\": { \"name\": \"Stop Coding\", \"one_liner\": \"...\", \"why_uncomfortable\": \"...\" },\n55\t  \"mission\": \"...\",\n56\t  \"phase_model\": { \"phase1_ai_coding\": \"...\", \"phase2_agentic_coding\": \"...\" },\n57\t  \"core_concepts\": [\n58\t    { \"id\": \"...\", \"name\": \"...\", \"plain_english\": \"...\", \"dan_words\": \"...\", \"misconception\": \"...\" }\n59\t  ],\n60\t  \"core_four\": { \"context\": \"\", \"model\": \"\", \"prompt\": \"\", \"tools\": \"\", \"why_scale_matters\": \"\" },\n61\t  \"ai_vs_agentic\": {\n62\t    \"ai_coding_prompt_summary\": \"\",\n63\t    \"agentic_coding_prompt_summary\": \"\",\n64\t    \"difference_that_matters\": \"\",\n65\t    \"codebase_paths\": []\n66\t  },\n67\t  \"programmable_agent\": {\n68\t    \"why_it_matters\": \"\",\n69\t    \"languages\": [\"shell\", \"typescript+bun\", \"python+uv\"],\n70\t    \"files\": []\n71\t  },\n72\t  \"loot_box_mentions\": [],\n73\t  \"step_by_step_demo\": [],\n74\t  \"quotes\": [{ \"text\": \"\", \"approx_timestamp\": \"\" }],\n75\t  \"prerequisites_tools\": [],\n76\t  \"what_student_must_internalize\": [],\n77\t  \"common_weak_student_failures\": [],\n78\t  \"teach_back_prompt\": \"\",\n79\t  \"retrieval_questions\": [{ \"q\": \"\", \"a\": \"\" }],\n80\t  \"codebase_map\": { \"files\": [], \"what_each_does\": {} },\n81\t  \"current_practice_gaps\": [\n82\t    { \"gap\": \"Agent Skills under-taught in TAC-1 era\", \"why\": \"\", \"yt_candidates\": [] }\n83\t  ],\n84\t  \"yt_overlay_candidates\": [\n85\t    {\n86\t      \"video_id\": \"\",\n87\t      \"title\": \"\",\n88\t      \"maps_to\": \"named hole | operationalizes tactic | corrects outdated\",\n89\t      \"include_in_phase1\": true,\n90\t      \"rationale\": \"\"\n91\t    }\n92\t  ],\n93\t  \"frame_plan\": [\n94\t    { \"t_seconds\": 0, \"label\": \"\", \"why_for_weak_student\": \"\", \"diagram_instead\": false }\n95\t  ],\n96\t  \"lab\": {\n97\t    \"setup\": [],\n98\t    \"reproduce_dan\": [],\n99\t    \"stretch\": [],\n100\t    \"pass_criteria\": []\n101\t  },\n102\t  \"estimated_print_pages_when_expanded\": 40,\n103\t  \"confidence_notes\": []\n104\t}\n105\t```\n106\t\n107\t### C) Teaching extract rules (weak student → expert)\n108\tFor every major idea: Hook → Picture description → Worked example from codebase → Name Dan’s term → Failure mode → Retrieval Q.\n109\t\n110\t### D) YT overlay selection (strict)\n111\tPhase-1 candidates ONLY if they map to TAC-1 named holes:\n112\t- Core Four / tools scale\n113\t- Programmable Claude Code / ADWs seed\n114\t- “AI coding is not enough”\n115\t- Stop coding / commander of compute\n116\t- Skills as modern encoding of engineering (named gap vs course era)\n117\t\n118\tSuggested seeds (verify relevance before include_in_phase1=true):\n119\t- 2TIXl2rlA6Q AI Coding is NOT ENOUGH\n120\t- 6fCqj4xFCZI How Claude Code CHANGED Engineering Forever\n121\t- X2ciJedw2vU RAW Agentic Coding: ZERO to Agent SKILL (gap: skills)\n122\t- fop_yxV-mPo Codebase Singularity\n123\t- hGg3nWp7afg 3 Codebase Folders\n124\tMax 1–3 include_in_phase1=true for TAC-1.\n125\t\n126\t### E) Frames\n127\tIf `ffmpeg` exists, extract 5–12 JPGs into `media/frames/tac-1/` using frame-plan timestamps from VTT. Prefer terminal/UI/architecture moments over talking head. Document paths in frame-plan.json.\n128\t\n129\t### F) Design tokens (light theme skeleton only)\n130\t`design/tokens.css` — modern light teaching UI: cream/off-white bg, dark ink text, one accent, readable type scale (system + one distinctive display if webfont optional), spacing, card radii. No heavy dark mode. `base.css` resets + prose. `components.css` stubs for: callout, diagram, frame-card, lab-box, retrieval-quiz, current-practice.\n131\t\n132\t### G) index.html stub\n133\tSimple hub listing TAC-1 as “in extract”, link to extracts, note GPT chapter pending.\n134\t\n135\t## Verification before you finish\n136\t- All deliverable paths exist\n137\t- extract.json validates as JSON\n138\t- codebase_map covers every real file under tac-1\n139\t- lab can be run only with course codebase\n140\t- Write `_extracts/tac-1-hello-agentic-coding/STATUS.md` with DONE + file list + any blockers\n141\t\n142\t## Out of scope\n143\t- Do not write vol-1-tac chapter HTML body\n144\t- Do not fetch/download full YT videos\n145\t- Do not touch PiCanvas\n146\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2b29d221-2a38-404f-babf-a4bbd9f0c72a","uuid":"10d777a5-9904-41e1-97d7-68261405c172","timestamp":"2026-07-12T14:06:28.991Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/kvnkishore/WebstormProjects/AgenticEngineer/IndyDevDan/book/_orchestration/TAC1-CLAUDE-EXTRACT.md","content":"# TAC-1 Gold Pilot — Claude Fable extract (Hermes-orchestrated)\n\nYou are the **technical accuracy expert** for the IndyDevDan Expert Book pilot.\n\n## Hard constraints\n- Write ONLY under: `/Users/kvnkishore/WebstormProjects/AgenticEngineer/IndyDevDan/book/`\n- Do NOT modify course source trees except reading them\n- Do NOT build the full HTML chapter (GPT does that next). You produce structured extract + book scaffold + design tokens skeleton.\n- Use maximum reasoning effort. Be exhaustive but structured.\n\n## Sources (READ thoroughly)\n1. Lesson root: `/Users/kvnkishore/WebstormProjects/AgenticEngineer/IndyDevDan/tac-1-hello-agentic-coding/`\n2. Transcript MD: `.../transcript/tac-1-hello-agentic-coding.md`\n3. Transcript VTT (timestamps): `.../transcript/tac-1-hello-agentic-coding.vtt`\n4. Notes: `.../transcript/tac-1-hello-agentic-coding-notes.md`\n5. Course page HTML + lesson.json under `metadata/`\n6. Codebase (symlink): `.../codebase/` → `AgenticEngineer/tac/tac-1` — read ALL files (README, prompts, programmable scripts, .claude settings)\n7. Video: `.../video/tac-1-hello-agentic-coding.mp4` (for frame timestamps only; do not re-encode whole video)\n\n## Deliverables (CREATE all of these)\n\n### A) Book scaffold\n```\nIndyDevDan/book/\n  README.md\n  index.html                 # temporary stub hub OK\n  design/\n    tokens.css\n    base.css\n    components.css\n  data/\n    curriculum.json          # Phase-1 map: 18 lessons, empty overlays placeholders\n  _extracts/\n    tac-1-hello-agentic-coding/\n      extract.json           # machine schema\n      extract.md             # human readable master notes\n      nuggets.md             # ranked nuggets for weak learners\n      outdated-vs-current.md # course gaps + YT overlay candidates\n      frame-plan.json        # timestamps + why each frame matters\n      lab-spec.md            # drills on course codebase only\n  media/frames/tac-1/        # extract 5–12 frames if ffmpeg available\n  vol-1-tac/                 # empty or stub README for later HTML\n  vol-2-ah/\n  vol-3-ma/\n```\n\n### B) extract.json schema (required fields)\n```json\n{\n  \"lesson_key\": \"tac-1-hello-agentic-coding\",\n  \"title\": \"Hello Agentic Coding\",\n  \"course\": \"TAC\",\n  \"order\": 1,\n  \"tactic\": { \"name\": \"Stop Coding\", \"one_liner\": \"...\", \"why_uncomfortable\": \"...\" },\n  \"mission\": \"...\",\n  \"phase_model\": { \"phase1_ai_coding\": \"...\", \"phase2_agentic_coding\": \"...\" },\n  \"core_concepts\": [\n    { \"id\": \"...\", \"name\": \"...\", \"plain_english\": \"...\", \"dan_words\": \"...\", \"misconception\": \"...\" }\n  ],\n  \"core_four\": { \"context\": \"\", \"model\": \"\", \"prompt\": \"\", \"tools\": \"\", \"why_scale_matters\": \"\" },\n  \"ai_vs_agentic\": {\n    \"ai_coding_prompt_summary\": \"\",\n    \"agentic_coding_prompt_summary\": \"\",\n    \"difference_that_matters\": \"\",\n    \"codebase_paths\": []\n  },\n  \"programmable_agent\": {\n    \"why_it_matters\": \"\",\n    \"languages\": [\"shell\", \"typescript+bun\", \"python+uv\"],\n    \"files\": []\n  },\n  \"loot_box_mentions\": [],\n  \"step_by_step_demo\": [],\n  \"quotes\": [{ \"text\": \"\", \"approx_timestamp\": \"\" }],\n  \"prerequisites_tools\": [],\n  \"what_student_must_internalize\": [],\n  \"common_weak_student_failures\": [],\n  \"teach_back_prompt\": \"\",\n  \"retrieval_questions\": [{ \"q\": \"\", \"a\": \"\" }],\n  \"codebase_map\": { \"files\": [], \"what_each_does\": {} },\n  \"current_practice_gaps\": [\n    { \"gap\": \"Agent Skills under-taught in TAC-1 era\", \"why\": \"\", \"yt_candidates\": [] }\n  ],\n  \"yt_overlay_candidates\": [\n    {\n      \"video_id\": \"\",\n      \"title\": \"\",\n      \"maps_to\": \"named hole | operationalizes tactic | corrects outdated\",\n      \"include_in_phase1\": true,\n      \"rationale\": \"\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"frame_plan\": [\n    { \"t_seconds\": 0, \"label\": \"\", \"why_for_weak_student\": \"\", \"diagram_instead\": false }\n  ],\n  \"lab\": {\n    \"setup\": [],\n    \"reproduce_dan\": [],\n    \"stretch\": [],\n    \"pass_criteria\": []\n  },\n  \"estimated_print_pages_when_expanded\": 40,\n  \"confidence_notes\": []\n}\n```\n\n### C) Teaching extract rules (weak student → expert)\nFor every major idea: Hook → Picture description → Worked example from codebase → Name Dan’s term → Failure mode → Retrieval Q.\n\n### D) YT overlay selection (strict)\nPhase-1 candidates ONLY if they map to TAC-1 named holes:\n- Core Four / tools scale\n- Programmable Claude Code / ADWs seed\n- “AI coding is not enough”\n- Stop coding / commander of compute\n- Skills as modern encoding of engineering (named gap vs course era)\n\nSuggested seeds (verify relevance before include_in_phase1=true):\n- 2TIXl2rlA6Q AI Coding is NOT ENOUGH\n- 6fCqj4xFCZI How Claude Code CHANGED Engineering Forever\n- X2ciJedw2vU RAW Agentic Coding: ZERO to Agent SKILL (gap: skills)\n- fop_yxV-mPo Codebase Singularity\n- hGg3nWp7afg 3 Codebase Folders\nMax 1–3 include_in_phase1=true for TAC-1.\n\n### E) Frames\nIf `ffmpeg` exists, extract 5–12 JPGs into `media/frames/tac-1/` using frame-plan timestamps from VTT. Prefer terminal/UI/architecture moments over talking head. Document paths in frame-plan.json.\n\n### F) Design tokens (light theme skeleton only)\n`design/tokens.css` — modern light teaching UI: cream/off-white bg, dark ink text, one accent, readable type scale (system + one distinctive display if webfont optional), spacing, card radii. No heavy dark mode. `base.css` resets + prose. `components.css` stubs for: callout, diagram, frame-card, lab-box, retrieval-quiz, current-practice.\n\n### G) index.html stub\nSimple hub listing TAC-1 as “in extract”, link to extracts, note GPT chapter pending.\n\n## Verification before you finish\n- All deliverable paths exist\n- extract.json validates as JSON\n- codebase_map covers every real file under tac-1\n- lab can be run only with course codebase\n- Write `_extracts/tac-1-hello-agentic-coding/STATUS.md` with DONE + file list + any blockers\n\n## Out of scope\n- Do not write vol-1-tac chapter HTML body\n- Do not fetch/download full YT videos\n- Do not touch PiCanvas\n","numLines":146,"startLine":1,"totalLines":146}}},{"type":"rate_limit_event","rate_limit_info":{"status":"allowed","resetsAt":1783866000,"rateLimitType":"five_hour","overageStatus":"rejected","overageDisabledReason":"org_level_disabled","isUsingOverage":false},"uuid":"9ecce071-7a05-47c3-89fa-7315cd960ef4","session_id":"2b29d221-2a38-404f-babf-a4bbd9f0c72a"},{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NzYJZCYf3anyetgJfxG1yh","type":"tool_result","content":"/Users/kvnkishore/WebstormProjects/AgenticEngineer/IndyDev