20:44.604\ntruth about what you'll\n\n838\n00:20:44.624 --> 00:20:46.263\nlearn in tactical agentic\n\n839\n00:20:46.263 --> 00:20:47.682\ncoding is this. To\n\n840\n00:20:47.682 --> 00:20:50.083\nbecome an irreplaceable engineer,\n\n841\n00:20:50.303 --> 00:20:52.541\nyou will replace yourself.\n\n842\n00:20:53.026 --> 00:20:54.285\nYou won't see any\n\n843\n00:20:54.285 --> 00:20:56.184\nvibe coders replicating what\n\n844\n00:20:56.184 --> 00:20:57.104\nyou'll be able to\n\n845\n00:20:57.104 --> 00:20:58.604\ndo when you finish\n\n846\n00:20:58.683 --> 00:21:01.143\ntactical agentic coding. Evolution\n\n846\n00:20:58.683 --> 00:21:01.143\ntactical agentic coding. Evolution\n\n847\n00:21:01.143 --> 00:21:02.481\nis hard. It's challenging.\n\n848\n00:21:02.481 --> 00:21:03.162\nWe're going to push\n\n849\n00:21:03.182 --> 00:21:04.662\nthrough hard concepts. On\n\n850\n00:21:04.662 --> 00:21:06.760\nlesson one, I've already\n\n851\n00:21:06.760 --> 00:21:08.619\nrequested that you stop\n\n852\n00:21:08.779 --> 00:21:09.960\ncoding, right? We're using\n\n853\n00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:10.818\nthe best tool for\n\n854\n00:21:10.818 --> 00:21:12.578\nthe job. Evolution forces\n\n855\n00:21:12.578 --> 00:21:13.718\nus to leave skills\n\n856\n00:21:13.718 --> 00:21:15.349\nbehind to adapt new\n\n857\n00:21:15.349 --> 00:21:16.709\nones and bet on\n\n858\n00:21:16.769 --> 00:21:18.528\npotential futures. But in\n\n859\n00:21:18.528 --> 00:21:20.028\nthe tech industry, this\n\n860\n00:21:20.028 --> 00:21:20.928\nis where all the\n\n861\n00:21:20.928 --> 00:21:22.386\nalpha lies. This is\n\n862\n00:21:22.386 --> 00:21:24.346\nwhere your asymmetric engineering\n\n863\n00:21:24.446 --> 00:21:26.445\nadvantage exists. It's in\n\n864\n00:21:26.445 --> 00:21:27.704\nthe future. It's in\n\n865\n00:21:27.724 --> 00:21:29.865\npushing what's possible forward.\n\n866\n00:21:29.904 --> 00:21:31.384\nLet's start scaling the\n\n866\n00:21:29.904 --> 00:21:31.384\nLet's start scaling the\n\n867\n00:21:31.384 --> 00:21:33.003\ncore for the Identic\n\n868\n00:21:33.003 --> 00:21:34.583\nPrompt and Cloud Code\n\n869\n00:21:34.603 --> 00:21:36.461\ninto real engineering work\n\n870\n00:21:36.741 --> 00:21:38.422\nacross worlds. the software\n\n871\n00:21:38.422 --> 00:21:40.121\ndevelopment lifecycle. Next up,\n\n872\n00:21:40.180 --> 00:21:41.440\nwe'll explore the most\n\n873\n00:21:41.539 --> 00:21:43.358\nimportant leverage points of\n\n874\n00:21:43.398 --> 00:21:44.597\nagentic coding so that\n\n875\n00:21:44.617 --> 00:21:45.396\n10 minutes of your\n\n876\n00:21:45.396 --> 00:21:46.696\nwork is equivalent to\n\n877\n00:21:46.696 --> 00:21:48.435\n60 minutes or more\n\n878\n00:21:48.435 --> 00:21:49.815\nof another engineer's work.\n\n879\n00:21:49.994 --> 00:21:51.453\nGreat job here. I'll\n\n880\n00:21:51.453 --> 00:21:52.073\nsee you in lesson\n\n881\n00:21:52.073 --> 00:21:52.553\ntwo.\n\n","numLines":1792,"startLine":1900,"totalLines":3691}}},{"type":"system","subtype":"thinking_tokens","estimated_tokens":50,"estimated_tokens_delta":50,"uuid":"b88c6c52-9848-4d95-be25-6dda8144db49","session_id":"2b29d221-2a38-404f-babf-a4bbd9f0c72a"},{"type":"system","subtype":"thinking_tokens","estimated_tokens":200,"estimated_tokens_delta":150,"uuid":"5a83d5b0-3099-42cc-a485-f95c279ea31a","session_id":"2b29d221-2a38-404f-babf-a4bbd9f0c72a"},{"type":"system","subtype":"thinking_tokens","estimated_tokens":350,"estimated_tokens_delta":150,"uuid":"5d32f5b4-5570-4b85-a484-ccca9a48e4e2","session_id":"2b29d221-2a38-404f-babf-a4bbd9f0c72a"},{"type":"system","subtype":"thinking_tokens","estimated_tokens":500,"estimated_tokens_delta":150,"uuid":"364e7d6e-ddba-4397-a901-4187bc3da1d5","session_id":"2b29d221-2a38-404f-babf-a4bbd9f0c72a"},{"type":"system","subtype":"thinking_tokens","estimated_tokens":650,"estimated_tokens_delta":150,"uuid":"17fb3264-eeb1-4279-a452-4e96dc3a2f41","session_id":"2b29d221-2a38-404f-babf-a4bbd9f0c72a"},{"type":"system","subtype":"thinking_toke