IndyDevDan/tac-4-afk-agents/transcript/tac-4-afk-agents-notes.md:21:With AFK agents, you go from prompt input to merged PR automatically. The agent executes the entire workflow - classification, planning, implementation, and review - without your direct intervention.
IndyDevDan/tac-4-afk-agents/transcript/tac-4-afk-agents-notes.md:42:The review system uses GitHub pull requests. After your AFK agent completes its work, it creates a PR for review. This gives you visibility and control over what gets merged while maintaining the autonomous workflow.
