rately.\n- All 17 frame files exist under `book/media/frames/tac-1/`; visuals spot-verified for t0162, t0790, t0845, t1250.\n- Quotes/timestamps cross-checked against the 3690-line VTT; video duration 1311s confirmed via ffprobe.\n- README \"35 lines\" claim verified exact.\n- YT overlays: exactly 3 `include_in_phase1: true` (2TIXl2rlA6Q, 6fCqj4xFCZI, X2ciJedw2vU) — within the 1–3 limit; 2 deferred.\n\n## Blockers\n\nNone.\n\n## Caveats for the next stage (GPT chapter build)\n\n- YT overlay IDs taken from the orchestration brief seed list; verify they resolve before publishing links (no video fetching done here, per brief).\n- `current_practice_gaps` written against mid-2026 Claude Code (Skills, Agent SDK, permission modes); re-check at publish time.\n- t1250 is B-roll — render the closing beat as a designed pull-quote (`diagram_instead: true`), not the frame.\n- Do NOT rebuild scaffold files; only the vol-1-tac chapter HTML body remains out of scope for extract passes.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2868,"cache_read_input_tokens":166635,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2868},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2b29d221-2a38-404f-babf-a4bbd9f0c72a","uuid":"064d198a-4728-42a8-b2d7-2c82eca6e58b","request_id":"req_011CcxJtDpkLyJjfuyYVMFzM"},{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018YkBUdStmr5fE9J5xP3di1","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /Users/kvnkishore/WebstormProjects/AgenticEngineer/IndyDevDan/book/_extracts/tac-1-hello-agentic-coding/STATUS.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2b29d221-2a38-404f-babf-a4bbd9f0c72a","uuid":"1bcee2d0-88a8-4b31-a674